\caption{The \rg{} architecture (top) and the reasoning-violation taxonomy (bottom). The formal layer produces a bound from raw frames; the AI layer turns the bound into an LLM explanation; the verification layer checks the explanation against the bound and reports violations with a severity. Reasoning is either faithful or unfaithful, and unfaithful reasoning is partitioned into the five classes V1--V5.}
\label{fig:arch}
